{"candidateAnswer":"Sentimental jewelry from their moms","evidence":"[D1:8 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Jolene: Staying connected is super important. Do you have something to remember her by? This pendant reminds me of my mother, she gave it to me in 2010  in Paris.\n[D1:9 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Deborah: Yes, I also have a pendant that reminds me of my mother. And what is special for you about your jewelry?","itemId":"urn:uuid:1a1174e6-cd0c-5d28-8152-dc49cdb2a1fe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c39aa63d4e5b024b9e3d7638aa8e29b9f2c87b089d818539a4e13101bc372856","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What symbolic gifts do Deborah and Jolene have from their mothers?","referenceAnswer":"pendants","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c39aa63d4e5b024b9e3d7638aa8e29b9f2c87b089d818539a4e13101bc372856"}}]}